   "t": 177,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/pp3ppp/5n2/3p4/8/2Pn1N1P/PP3PP1/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 0 9",
   "line": [
    "Nxd3+"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight takes on d3 with check, handing Black the bishop pair — the long-term trump that justifies the isolated d-pawn.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Trade a knight for the bishop holding the position together to bank the bishop pair."
  },
