   "spoken": "A common White error worth knowing: the knight to c3 occupies the very square the c-pawn needs. With c3 unavailable to support d4, the isolated pawn is left permanently weak and easy to target.",
   "kind": "review",
   "teaches": "Don't block your own c-pawn with the knight when that pawn is needed to prop up d4."
